성, 잔차 분리)"],"metadata":{"id":"3PMBILldJqyo"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from statsmodels.tsa.seasonal import STL\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","\n","# STL 분해\n","stl = STL(\n","    df[TARGET],\n","    period=12,        # 12개월 계절 주기\n","    robust=True       # 이상치에 강건한 분해\n",")\n","result = stl.fit()\n","\n","# 시각화\n","fig, axes = plt.subplots(4, 1, figsize=(14, 14))\n","\n","# 원시계열\n","axes[0].plot(df['date'], df[TARGET],\n","             color='steelblue', linewidth=1.2)\n","axes[0].set_title('원시계열', fontsize=10)\n","axes[0].set_ylabel('흉악범죄율')\n","axes[0].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","# 추세\n","axes[1].plot(df['date'], result.trend,\n","             color='tomato', linewidth=1.5)\n","axes[1].set_title('추세 (Trend)', fontsize=10)\n","axes[1].set_ylabel('추세')\n","axes[1].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","# 계절성\n","axes[2].plot(df['date'], result.seasonal,\n","             color='seagreen', linewidth=1.2)\n","axes[2].axhline(0, color='black', linewidth=0.8, alpha=0.5)\n","axes[2].set_title('계절성 (Seasonal)', fontsize=10)\n","axes[2].set_ylabel('계절성')\n","axes[2].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","# 잔차\n","axes[3].plot(df['date'], result.resid,\n","             color='darkorange', linewidth=1.0)\n","axes[3].axhline(0, color='black', linewidth=0.8, alpha=0.5)\n","\n","# 코로나 구간 음영\n","covid = df[df['covid_dummy'] == 1]['date']\n","for ax in axes:\n","    ax.axvspan(covid.min(), covid.max(),\n","               alpha=0.08, color='gray', label='코로나 구간')\n","\n","axes[3].set_title('잔차 (Residual)', fontsize=10)\n","axes[3].set_ylabel('잔차')\n","axes[3].set_xlabel('날짜')\n","axes[3].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","plt.suptitle('흉악범죄율 STL 분해 (추세 + 계절성 + 잔차)',\n","             fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n","\n","# 분해 기여도 출력\n","total_var    = df[TARGET].var()\n","trend_var    = result.trend.var()\n","seasonal_var = result.seasonal.var()\n","resid_var    = result.resid.var()\n","\n","print(f\"추세 기여도:   {trend_var/total_var*100:.1f}%\")\n","print(f\"계절성 기여도: {seasonal_var/total_var*100:.1f}%\")\n","print(f\"잔차 기여도:   {resid_var/total_var*100:.1f}%\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":1000},"id":"rJ4xIff1QbOi","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1780133052241,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":1033,"user":{"displayName":"hee","userId":"11893382154411689325"}},"outputId":"7ed7e3f6-7d43-4bad-f9d8-aa52580c62d7"},"execution_count":39,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1400x1400 with 4 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["추세 기여도:   22.3%\n","계절성 기여도: 60.7%\n","잔차 기여도:   8.9%\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 각 성분 해석\n","🔵 원시계열\n","\n","계절 패턴 + 2022년 급등 명확\n","\n","---\n","\n","🔴 추세 (Trend)\n","\n","- 2014~2020: 5.5 수준으로 안정\n","- 2020~2022: 5.5 → 7.0 급등 → 코로나 이후\n","- 구조적 변화\n","- 2022~2024: 다시 하락 중 → 아직 코로나 전 수준 미회복\n","\n","---\n","\n","🟢 계절성 (Seasonal)\n","\n","- 매년 여름 +1.5, 겨울 -1.5 로 일정하게 반복\n","- 계절 패턴이 매우 안정적 → 기온 효과 일관성 확인\n","\n","---\n","\n","🟠 잔차 (Residual)\n","\n","- 평소 0 근처에서 안정적\n","- 2020~2022년 구간에서 큰 spike → 코로나 설명 안 되는 이상 변동\n","- 잔차가 작다 → STL이 데이터를 잘 설명함"],"metadata":{"id":"IUJxcJNaQsuZ"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### ADF 및 KPSS 검정 수행 (정상 / 비정상 판정) -> step 4에서 이미 함"],"metadata":{"id":"kahRy8RxJq4A"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 변화점 탐지 수행 (PELT / CUSUM 알고리즘 활용)"],"metadata":{"id":"vBRmLk5dJq9I"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","# ruptures 설치\n","import subprocess\n","subprocess.run(['pip', 'install', 'ruptures', '--break-system-packages', '-q'])\n","\n","import ruptures as rpt\n","\n","signal = df[TARGET].values\n","\n","fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 1, figsize=(14, 10))\n","\n","# --- 위: PELT 알고리즘 ---\n","ax1 = axes[0]\n","\n","model_pelt = rpt.Pelt(model='rbf').fit(signal)\n","breaks_pelt = model_pelt.predict(pen=3)\n","\n","ax1.plot(df['date'], signal, color='steelblue', linewidth=1.5, label='흉악범죄율')\n","\n","# 변화점 수직선\n","for bp in breaks_pelt[:-1]:\n","    bp_date = df['date'].iloc[bp - 1]\n","    ax1.axvline(bp_date, color='tomato', linestyle='--',\n","                linewidth=2, alpha=0.8)\n","    ax1.text(bp_date, signal.max() * 0.97,\n","             bp_date.strftime('%Y.%m'),\n","             color='tomato', fontsize=8, ha='center')\n","\n","# 코로나 구간\n","covid = df[df['covid_dummy'] == 1]['date']\n","ax1.axvspan(covid.min(), covid.max(),\n","            alpha=0.08, color='gray', label='코로나 구간')\n","\n","ax1.set_title(f'PELT 변화점 탐지 (변화점 {len(breaks_pelt)-1}개)', fontsize=11)\n","ax1.set_ylabel('흉악범죄율')\n","ax1.legend(fontsize=9)\n","ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","# --- 아래: CUSUM ---\n","ax2 = axes[1]\n","\n","# CUSUM 계산\n","mean_val = signal.mean()\n","cusum_pos = np.zeros(len(signal))\n","cusum_neg = np.zeros(len(signal))\n","\n","for t in range(1, len(signal)):\n","    cusum_pos[t] = max(0, cusum_pos[t-1] + signal[t] - mean_val)\n","    cusum_neg[t] = min(0, cusum_neg[t-1] + signal[t] - mean_val)\n","\n","ax2.plot(df['date'], cusum_pos, color='tomato',\n","         linewidth=1.5, label='CUSUM+')\n","ax2.plot(df['date'], cusum_neg, color='steelblue',\n","         linewidth=1.5, label='CUSUM-')\n","ax2.axhline(0, color='black', linewidth=0.8)\n","ax2.axvspan(covid.min(), covid.max(),\n","            alpha=0.08, color='gray', label='코로나 구간')\n","\n","ax2.set_title('CUSUM 변화점 탐지', fontsize=11)\n","ax2.set_ylabel('누적합')\n","ax2.set_xlabel('날짜')\n","ax2.legend(fontsize=9)\n","ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","plt.suptitle('흉악범죄율 변화점 탐지 (PELT + CUSUM)',\n","             fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n","\n","# 변화점 날짜 출력\n","print(\"\\n📍 PELT 변화점 탐지 결과\")\n","print(\"-\" * 30)\n","for bp in breaks_pelt[:-1]:\n","    print(f\"변화점: {df['date'].iloc[bp-1].strftime('%Y년 %m월')}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":799},"id":"tNIrkdYERthR","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1780133056053,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":3811,"user":{"displayName":"hee","userId":"11893382154411689325"}},"outputId":"60fe5702-4f84-4807-92d5-dfc23422db93"},"execution_count":40,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1400x1000 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","📍 PELT 변화점 탐지 결과\n","------------------------------\n","변화점: 2022년 04월\n","변화점: 2022년 09월\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["#*6 CCF 교차상관 분석 (잔차 기반)*"],"metadata":{"id":"dOxDq_duJrOw"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### STL 잔차 기반 CCF 분석"],"metadata":{"id":"7u4q7w49JrTG"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import numpy as np\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import pandas as pd\n","\n","# STL 잔차 추출\n","resid = result.resid\n","\n","final_weather = [\n","    ('temp_avg',        '월평균 기온 (°C)'),\n","    ('heatwave_days',   '폭염일수 (일)'),\n","    ('humidity_avg',    '월평균 습도 (%)'),\n","    ('sunshine_hours',  '일조시간 (hr)'),\n","    ('solar_radiation', '일사량 (MJ/m²)'),\n","    ('precip_mm',       '월 총강수량 (mm)'),\n","]\n","\n","fig, axes = plt.subplots(3, 2, figsize=(14, 12))\n","axes = axes.flatten()\n","\n","# 최적 시차 저장\n","best_lags = {}\n","\n","for i, (col, label) in enumerate(final_weather):\n","    ax = axes[i]\n","\n","    lags = range(-12, 13)\n","    ccf_vals = []\n","\n","    for lag in lags:\n","        if lag < 0:\n","            r = df[col].shift(-lag).corr(resid)\n","        elif lag == 0:\n","            r = df[col].corr(resid)\n","        else:\n","            r = df[col].shift(lag).corr(resid)\n","        ccf_vals.append(r)\n","\n","    # 신뢰구간\n","    n = len(df)\n","    conf = 1.96 / np.sqrt(n)\n","\n","    # 막대그래프\n","    colors = ['tomato' if abs(v) > conf else 'steelblue' for v in ccf_vals]\n","    ax.bar(list(lags), ccf_vals, color=colors, alpha=0.7)\n","\n","    ax.axhline(conf,  color='gray', linestyle='--', linewidth=1, alpha=0.7)\n","    ax.axhline(-conf, color='gray', linestyle='--', linewidth=1, alpha=0.7)\n","    ax.axhline(0, color='black', linewidth=0.8)\n","    ax.axvline(0, color='black', linewidth=0.5, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","    # 최대 시차 표시\n","    max_idx  = np.argmax(np.abs(ccf_vals))\n","    max_lag  = list(lags)[max_idx]\n","    max_val  = ccf_vals[max_idx]\n","    best_lags[col] = {'lag': max_lag, 'r': round(max_val, 3)}\n","\n","    ax.annotate(f'최대: lag {max_lag}\\nr={max_val:.3f}',\n","                xy=(max_lag, max_val),\n","                xytext=(max_lag + 2, max_val - 0.05),\n","                fontsize=8,\n","                arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle='->', color='black'))\n","\n","    ax.set_title(f'{label} × 잔차 CCF', fontsize=10)\n","    ax.set_xlabel('Lag (개월)', fontsize=9)\n","    ax.set_ylabel('교차상관계수', fontsize=9)\n","    ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","plt.suptitle('STL 잔차 기반 CCF 교차상관 분석',\n","             fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n","\n","# 최적 시차 표 출력\n","print(\"\\n📊 최적 시차 확정 결과\")\n","print(\"-\" * 40)\n","lag_summary = pd.DataFrame(best_lags).T\n","lag_summary.index.name = '변수'\n","print(lag_summary.to_string())"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":1000},"id":"oYFCbjjCRTkg","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1780133057994,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":1941,"user":{"displayName":"hee","userId":"11893382154411689325"}},"outputId":"dd52809f-f93b-4527-e686-1d2f0e039bc4"},"execution_count":41,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1400x1200 with 6 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","📊 최적 시차 확정 결과\n","----------------------------------------\n","                  lag      r\n","변수                          \n","temp_avg         -5.0 -0.255\n","heatwave_days   -10.0  0.237\n","humidity_avg    -10.0  0.314\n","sunshine_hours   -3.0  0.204\n","solar_radiation  -7.0 -0.248\n","precip_mm       -10.0  0.275\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 최적시차 (lag) 확정"],"metadata":{"id":"Pq9lQi5UJrX2"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# 원시계열 CCF vs 잔차 기반 CCF 비교\n","\n","# temp_avg       0.780 → -0.253  (계절성 제거 후 약해짐)\n","# solar_radiation 0.754 → -0.248  (동일)\n","# humidity_avg   0.452 →  0.315  (잔차에서도 유지)\n","# precip_mm      0.508 →  0.275  (유지)\n","# heatwave_days  0.378 →  0.237  (유지)\n","# sunshine_hours 0.215 →  0.206  (거의 동일)"],"metadata":{"id":"WmgLUtT0TGc5","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1780133057996,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":1,"user":{"displayName":"hee","userId":"11893382154411689325"}}},"execution_count":42,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# temp_avg        → lag 0\n","# solar_radiation → lag 0~1\n","# humidity_avg    → lag 0\n","# heatwave_days   → lag 0\n","# precip_mm       → lag 0\n","# sunshine_hours  → lag 2"],"metadata":{"id":"V59ZDsKqTGkA","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1780133057998,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":1,"user":{"displayName":"hee","userId":"11893382154411689325"}}},"execution_count":43,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["#*7 비선형 임계점 분석*"],"metadata":{"id":"rCvspHzeJrZw"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import numpy as np\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\n","\n","fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(14, 10))\n","axes = axes.flatten()\n","\n","# --- 1. temp_avg 구간별 회귀 ---\n","ax1 = axes[0]\n","x = df['temp_avg'].values\n","y = df[TARGET].values\n","\n","# 임계점 탐색 (5°C 간격)\n","thresholds = [0, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25]\n","colors_seg = ['steelblue', 'seagreen', 'orange', 'tomato', 'purple']\n","\n","ax1.scatter(x, y, alpha=0.3, s=15, color='gray')\n","\n","for i in range(len(thresholds)-1):\n","    mask = (x >= thresholds[i]) & (x < thresholds[i+1])\n","    if mask.sum() > 3:\n","        x_seg = x[mask].reshape(-1, 1)\n","        y_seg = y[mask]\n","        reg = LinearRegression().fit(x_seg, y_seg)\n","        x_plot = np.linspace(thresholds[i], thresholds[i+1], 50)\n","        ax1.plot(x_plot, reg.predict(x_plot.reshape(-1, 1)),\n","                color=colors_seg[i], linewidth=2.5,\n","                label=f'{thresholds[i]}~{thresholds[i+1]}°C (β={reg.coef_[0]:.3f})')\n","\n","ax1.set_title('temp_avg 구간별 회귀 (Piecewise)', fontsize=10)\n","ax1.set_xlabel('월평균 기온 (°C)')\n","ax1.set_ylabel('흉악범죄율')\n","ax1.legend(fontsize=7)\n","ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","# --- 2. heatwave_days 누적 효과 ---\n","ax2 = axes[1]\n","\n","# 폭염일수 구간\n","bins   = [0, 1, 4, 8, 20]\n","labels = ['0일', '1~3일', '4~7일', '8일+']\n","df['hw_bin'] = pd.cut(df['heatwave_days'], bins=bins,\n","                       labels=labels, right=False)\n","\n","hw_mean = df.groupby('hw_bin')[TARGET].mean()\n","hw_std  = df.groupby('hw_bin')[TARGET].std()\n","\n","bars = ax2.bar(labels, hw_mean.values,\n","               yerr=hw_std.values,\n","               color=['steelblue', 'orange', 'orangered', 'darkred'],\n","               alpha=0.8, capsize=5)\n","\n","for bar, val in zip(bars, hw_mean.values):\n","    ax2.text(bar.get_x() + bar.get_width()/2, val + 0.05,\n","             f'{val:.2f}', ha='center', fontsize=10, fontweight='bold')\n","\n","ax2.set_title('폭염일수 구간별 흉악범죄율 (누적 효과)', fontsize=10)\n","ax2.set_xlabel('폭염일수 구간')\n","ax2.set_ylabel('평균 흉악범죄율')\n","ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='y')\n","\n","# --- 3. temp_avg 임계점 탐색 ---\n","ax3 = axes[2]\n","\n","thresholds_search = np.arange(5, 25, 1)\n","r_squared = []\n","\n","for thr in thresholds_search:\n","    low  = df[df['temp_avg'] <  thr][TARGET].mean()\n","    high = df[df['temp_avg'] >= thr][TARGET].mean()\n","    r_squared.append(high - low)\n","\n","ax3.plot(thresholds_search, r_squared, color='tomato', linewidth=2, marker='o', markersize=4)\n","ax3.axvline(thresholds_search[np.argmax(r_squared)],\n","            color='black', linestyle='--', linewidth=1.5,\n","            label=f'최대 임계점: {thresholds_search[np.argmax(r_squared)]}°C')\n","ax3.set_title('기온 임계점 탐색 (구간 평균 차이)', fontsize=10)\n","ax